<h2>2026-10-15 — Pipelines v3 endpoint shipped</h2>
<p><a href="/api/pipelines">Pipelines v3</a> is now the current version of the pipelines endpoint. The legacy <a href="/api/pipelines-v2">v2 Pipelines endpoint</a> remains supported for existing integrations.</p>

<h2>2026-08-01 — Webhooks generally available</h2>
<p>The <a href="/api/webhooks">Webhooks endpoint</a> is now generally available for all workspaces, with signed payload verification.</p>

