<h1>Events endpoint <span class='chip chip--primary'>v3</span></h1>
<p>Query and replay <a href="/concepts/events">events</a> that have flowed through a pipeline. Base URL: <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>.</p>

<h2 id="list">List events</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events</code> — cursor-paginated, filterable by <code>type</code> and <code>occurred_at</code> range.</p>

